   "partial_notes": [],
   "first_removed": "This theme is a [https://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/component:sigma-plus Sigma Plus] theme and uses the [https://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/component:toggle-sidebar Toggle Sidebar Component] and the [https://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/component:betterfootnotes Better Footnotes Component]. Aesthetically, this theme uses lots of large, chunky blocks and lots of oranges and green, cause science... is orange. And biology? Green.",
